Error [jet.ValueTypeMismatch]: `Cell<fn() -> Int>.get()` cannot copy its value
  --> tests/ui/local_cell_copy_law.jet:1:53
    |
  1 | get_callback: fn(cell: Cell<fn() -> Int>) { _: cell.get() }
    |                                                     ^^^
 Why: `get` returns an independent owned value, so the stored type must support copying
 Fix: Use `.read(value -> ...)` to inspect it without making a copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0112

Error [jet.ValueTypeMismatch]: `Cell<[fn() -> Int]?>.get_or_set()` cannot copy its value
  --> tests/ui/local_cell_copy_law.jet:3:64
    |
  3 | get_callbacks_or_set: fn(cell: Cell<[fn() -> Int]?>) { _: cell.get_or_set(() -> [() -> 1]) }
    |                                                                ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `get_or_set` returns an independent owned value, so `T` must support copying
 Fix: Use `.edit(value -> ...)` when the cached value cannot be copied
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0112
